    <string name="tv_standby">Reachable in Standby</string>
    <string name="tv_standby_desc">Keeps background reception available. Discovery and display wake during standby still depend on TV firmware; power use may increase. Turn off to allow idle CPU sleep, which may make the TV unavailable.</string>
    <string name="tv_advanced_desc">Every original option, including port, discovery, decoding and developer settings.</string>

